{
  "conversation_lines": [
    {
      "turn_number": 1,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:09:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Hello, I'm Dr. Lee, one of your doctors here. You were brought in from rehab because you've been feeling more tired and not eating well. Can you tell me how you're feeling now?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 2,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:10:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I'm just so tired… I don’t have any energy. I haven’t been hungry either."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 3,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:11:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I see. The nurses also mentioned some pain and skin sores. Are you having pain anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 4,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:12:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yes, my right thigh hurts a lot. And there’s another sore under my breast."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 5,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:13:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We noticed those. They look infected, and given your history of calciphylaxis, we need to treat them carefully. We’ve started antibiotics to cover possible infections."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 6,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:14:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Calciphylaxis… that’s the skin problem from my kidney disease, right?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 7,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Exactly. It causes calcium to build up in your skin and leads to sores. We’re giving you sodium thiosulfate with dialysis to help with that."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 8,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:16:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay… but why am I so weak?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 9,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:17:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "A few things: the infection, poor intake, and your chronic anemia. Your hemoglobin was low, so we gave you a unit of blood yesterday."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 10,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:18:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Oh… I remember bleeding a bit down there. Is that why?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 11,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:19:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Yes, you had vaginal bleeding. We tried an ultrasound, but you couldn’t tolerate it. The bleeding has slowed, and your levels are stable for now."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 12,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:20:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’m scared… is this going to get worse?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 13,
      "time": "2122-03-03 22:21:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re doing everything we can. But I won’t lie—your conditions are serious. We’ll keep treating the infection and support you as best we can."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 14,
      "time": "2122-03-04 08:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good morning. We placed a new IV line yesterday to help give your antibiotics and fluids. How’s your pain today?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 15,
      "time": "2122-03-04 08:16:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Still hurts… especially when they clean the wound."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 16,
      "time": "2122-03-04 08:17:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I’ll adjust your pain meds. We’re using oxycodone as needed, but we can add something else if needed."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 17,
      "time": "2122-03-04 08:18:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you… I just want to feel more comfortable."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 18,
      "time": "2122-03-05 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your white blood cell count is still high, which means the infection is still active. We’re keeping you on strong antibiotics."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 19,
      "time": "2122-03-05 10:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Is it not working?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 20,
      "time": "2122-03-05 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "It’s helping, but your sores are getting bigger. We’re worried the infection is spreading despite treatment."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 21,
      "time": "2122-03-06 14:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We did a CT scan of your leg yesterday. It shows cellulitis but no abscess. That’s good—no need for surgery."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 22,
      "time": "2122-03-06 14:31:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "So what now?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 23,
      "time": "2122-03-06 14:32:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re changing your antibiotics. We found gram-negative rods in the wound, so we’re switching to ceftazidime and metronidazole."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 24,
      "time": "2122-03-07 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your sister and daughters visited yesterday. We talked about your condition and what might happen if things worsen."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 25,
      "time": "2122-03-07 09:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "What did they say?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 26,
      "time": "2122-03-07 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "They understand this is very serious. We discussed making you DNR/DNI if your body starts shutting down, so you’re not put through painful measures."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 27,
      "time": "2122-03-07 09:03:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yes… I don’t want to suffer. I just want to be with my family."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 28,
      "time": "2122-03-07 09:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll make sure you’re comfortable. Your family will be here with you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 29,
      "time": "2122-03-08 11:20:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You had a brief episode of fast heart rate during dialysis. It was atrial tachycardia. We increased your metoprolol to control it."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 30,
      "time": "2122-03-08 11:21:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I didn’t feel it… just got a little dizzy."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 31,
      "time": "2122-03-08 11:22:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That’s common. We’ll keep monitoring your heart, especially during dialysis."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 32,
      "time": "2122-03-09 13:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your wound cultures came back. It’s a gram-negative infection, which we’re already treating. But your body isn’t healing."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 33,
      "time": "2122-03-09 13:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Will I ever get better?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 34,
      "time": "2122-03-09 13:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I’m sorry… with your kidney disease, diabetes, and calciphylaxis, your body can’t fight this off like a healthier person could."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 35,
      "time": "2122-03-10 15:45:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You had another episode of low blood pressure and confusion last night. It resolved, but it’s a sign your body is struggling."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 36,
      "time": "2122-03-10 15:46:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I just want to rest…"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 37,
      "time": "2122-03-11 08:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re seeing more sores developing. Despite antibiotics, the infection is spreading. We may need to move you to the ICU if things worsen."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 38,
      "time": "2122-03-12 10:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your breathing is a bit faster today. We did a chest X-ray—it shows some fluid in your lungs, likely from heart strain."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 39,
      "time": "2122-03-12 10:31:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I feel short of breath…"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 40,
      "time": "2122-03-12 10:32:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll give you oxygen and monitor closely. Your heart and kidneys are under stress."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 41,
      "time": "2122-03-13 14:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You had another episode of fast heart rate. This time it turned into atrial fibrillation with low blood pressure. We’re transferring you to the ICU."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 42,
      "time": "2122-03-13 14:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Is this the end?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 43,
      "time": "2122-03-13 14:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re going to do everything to keep you comfortable. You’ll have pain medicine and your family will be with you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 44,
      "time": "2122-03-14 07:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "In the ICU, we’ve started stronger antibiotics—vancomycin and meropenem—and are using medicines to support your blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 45,
      "time": "2122-03-14 07:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "It’s hard to breathe…"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 46,
      "time": "2122-03-14 07:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re not going to intubate you—you’re DNR/DNI. We’ll keep you on oxygen and give medicine to ease your breathing and pain."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 47,
      "time": "2122-03-15 11:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We did another CT of your head because you’ve been less responsive. It shows no new stroke, but you’re very weak from the infection."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 48,
      "time": "2122-03-16 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your blood pressure is very low despite three medicines to support it. Your organs are failing."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 49,
      "time": "2122-03-16 09:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Tell my daughters I love them…"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 50,
      "time": "2122-03-16 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "They’re here. They’ve been holding your hands. We’re giving you medicine to keep you comfortable."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 51,
      "time": "2122-03-17 20:45:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your breathing is slower. Your daughters are with you, telling you they love you. You’re not alone."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 52,
      "time": "2122-03-18 06:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your blood pressure is not responding. We’ve stopped trying to raise it. You’re on comfort care only."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 53,
      "time": "2122-03-18 14:20:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your breathing is very shallow. Your daughters are here, holding you. You’re not in pain."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 54,
      "time": "2122-03-18 22:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your heart rate is slowing. We’re staying with you. Your family is saying goodbye."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 55,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:45:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I’m checking for any signs of life. There’s no pulse, no breathing, no response to pain."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 56,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:46:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I’m sorry… she has passed away. It happened peacefully, with her daughters by her side."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 57,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:47:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll give your family some time alone with her."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 58,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:48:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "She is now at peace."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 59,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:49:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The time of death is recorded as 23:48."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 60,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:50:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll notify the team and begin the next steps."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 61,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:51:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "She died from complications of severe infection and multi-organ failure."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 62,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:52:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Her battle was long, but she was surrounded by love at the end."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 63,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:53:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll make sure her family has all the support they need."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 64,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:54:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "This has been a difficult journey for everyone."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 65,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:55:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We did everything medically appropriate, but her body could not recover."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 66,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:56:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Her comfort was our priority in these final hours."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 67,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:57:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The nurses are preparing her now."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 68,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:58:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll document everything carefully."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 69,
      "time": "2122-03-18 23:59:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "She was a strong woman, facing many challenges with dignity."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 70,
      "time": "2122-03-19 00:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We will remember her."
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "admission_start": "2122-03-03 22:09:00",
    "admission_end": "2122-03-19 00:00:00",
    "summary_paragraph": "The patient was admitted from a rehab facility for lethargy, failure to thrive, and multiple skin ulcers in the setting of end-stage renal disease and calciphylaxis. She presented with vaginal bleeding, anemia requiring transfusion, and a large infected thigh ulcer. Despite broad-spectrum antibiotics and aggressive medical management, her soft tissue infection progressed, leading to sepsis, atrial fibrillation, and hypotension. She was transferred to the ICU where vasopressors were initiated, but her condition deteriorated. Goals of care were discussed with family, and she was designated DNR/DNI. She received comfort care and passed peacefully with her daughters at her bedside.",
    "problems": [
      "Local infection of the skin and subcutaneous tissue, unspecified",
      "End stage renal disease",
      "Hypertensive heart and chronic kidney disease with heart failure and with stage 5 chronic kidney disease, or end stage renal disease",
      "Pressure ulcer of sacral region, unstageable",
      "Toxic encephalopathy",
      "Type 2 diabetes mellitus with diabetic chronic kidney disease",
      "Unspecified atrial fibrillation",
      "Supraventricular tachycardia",
      "Chronic diastolic (congestive) heart failure",
      "Hemiplegia and hemiparesis following unspecified cerebrovascular disease affecting left non-dominant side",
      "Non-pressure chronic ulcer of right thigh with unspecified severity",
      "Calcinosis cutis",
      "Epilepsy, unspecified, not intractable, without status epilepticus",
      "Adult failure to thrive",
      "Do not resuscitate",
      "Gout, unspecified",
      "Atherosclerotic heart disease of native coronary artery without angina pectoris",
      "Presence of aortocoronary bypass graft",
      "Dependence on renal dialysis",
      "Long term (current) use of insulin",
      "Type 2 diabetes mellitus with unspecified diabetic retinopathy without macular edema",
      "Obesity, unspecified",
      "Body mass index [BMI] 37.0-37.9, adult",
      "Personal history of pulmonary embolism",
      "Abnormal uterine and vaginal bleeding, unspecified",
      "Insomnia, unspecified",
      "Other hyperparathyroidism"
    ]
  }
}
